WEBVTT

00:00:05.856 --> 00:00:07.856
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi! I’m Jim.

00:00:08.205 --> 00:00:12.477
<v><b>B:</b></v> So am I. Great to meet you. Sit down.

00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:14.960
Are you married, Jim?

00:00:15.206 --> 00:00:18.785
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes… well, I’ve been married twice.

00:00:18.927 --> 00:00:22.490
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah? So have I. Do you have any children?

00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:24.100
<v><b>A:</b></v> I have one son.

00:00:24.243 --> 00:00:26.656
<v><b>B:</b></v> So do I. What’s his name?

00:00:27.203 --> 00:00:28.554
<v><b>A:</b></v> James Allen.

00:00:29.006 --> 00:00:34.943
<v><b>B:</b></v> That’s amazing! My son’s name is James Allen, too.

00:00:35.331 --> 00:00:37.235
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you go to college, Jim?

00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:38.584
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I didn’t.

00:00:38.727 --> 00:00:41.528
<v><b>A:</b></v> Neither did I. I was a terrible student.

00:00:41.553 --> 00:00:43.553
<v><b>B:</b></v> So was I.

00:00:44.481 --> 00:00:47.057
Hey, this is my dog, Toy.

00:00:47.215 --> 00:00:51.259
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t believe it! My dog’s called Toy, too!

00:00:52.155 --> 00:00:55.581
<v><b>B:</b></v> He wants to go outside. My wife usually takes him.

00:00:56.129 --> 00:00:58.688
I don’t do any exercise at all.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:03.611
<v><b>A:</b></v> Don’t worry. Neither do I. I drive everywhere.

00:01:04.182 --> 00:01:05.563
<v><b>B:</b></v> What car do you have?

00:01:05.888 --> 00:01:07.022
<v><b>B:</b></v> A Chevrolet.

00:01:07.323 --> 00:01:08.521
<v><b>A:</b></v> So do I!

00:01:09.124 --> 00:01:10.578
<v><b>A and B:</b></v> Let’s have a beer, Jim.

00:01:12.414 --> 00:01:13.898
<v><b>A:</b></v> What beer do you drink?

00:01:14.072 --> 00:01:14.820
<v><b>B:</b></v> Miller Lite.

00:01:14.939 --> 00:01:16.097
<v><b>A:</b></v> So do I!